students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%8D%89%20%E9%81%A5%E9%A6%99/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/cn/ch0087_login_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0087_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"欢迎回来，老师！ 我，我一直在等您！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%8D%89%20%E9%81%A5%E9%A6%99/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/cn/ch0087_login_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0087_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"噫，噫……？！ 啊，啊……老师……？！ 什，什么时候……？！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%8D%89%20%E9%81%A5%E9%A6%99/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/cn/ch0087_memoriallobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0087_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"不，不是的！ 我……我没打算质问您！！ 真的！！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%8D%89%20%E9%81%A5%E9%A6%99/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/cn/ch0087_memoriallobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0087_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"咦？ 好像之前也 发生过类似的事情呢……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%8D%89%20%E9%81%A5%E9%A6%99/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/cn/ch0087_memoriallobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0087_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"啊，啊……？ 您是说这个吗？ 这个是……门松……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%8D%89%20%E9%81%A5%E9%A6%99/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/cn/ch0087_memoriallobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0087_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"因为老师说， 这种事情最重要的，是心意……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%8D%89%20%E9%81%A5%E9%A6%99/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/cn/ch0087_memoriallobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0087_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"所以我想着用亲手养大的 这孩子来做的话，应该还不错。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%8D%89%20%E9%81%A5%E9%A6%99/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/cn/ch0087_memoriallobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0087_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"难，难道说， 我又做了些多余的 事情吗……？！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%8D%89%20%E9%81%A5%E9%A6%99/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/cn/ch0087_memoriallobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0087_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"对不起， 对不起对不起对不起对不起……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%8D%89%20%E9%81%A5%E9%A6%99/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/cn/ch0087_memoriallobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0087_memoriallobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"呃，唔……？！ 啊……？ 真，真的，吗……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%8D%89%20%E9%81%A5%E9%A6%99/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/cn/ch0087_memoriallobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0087_memoriallobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"真的……没关系吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%8D%89%20%E9%81%A5%E9%A6%99/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/cn/ch0087_memoriallobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0087_memoriallobby_5_3","category":"lobby","text":"……嘿…… ……嘿嘿……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%8D%89%20%E9%81%A5%E9%A6%99/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/cn/ch0087_memoriallobby_5_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0087_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"啊，啊……！老师给我的恩情，已经太多了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%8D%89%20%E9%81%A5%E9%A6%99/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/cn/ch0087_relationship_up_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0087_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"虽然我这个人一无是处，但只要是老师吩咐的，我都一定会做到的！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%8D%89%20%E9%81%A5%E9%A6%99/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/cn/ch0087_relationship_up_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0087_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"对不起…不不对……谢谢您。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%8D%89%20%E9%81%A5%E9%A6%99/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/cn/ch0087_relationship_up_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0087_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"今年也……请您多多关照，啊绝、绝对没有强迫您的意思！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%8D%89%20%E9%81%A5%E9%A6%99/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/cn/ch0087_relationship_up_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0087_season_birthday","category":"lobby","text":"我，我的生日吗……？！为，为什么要特意去 记这种无聊的事情……？！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%8D%89%20%E9%81%A5%E9%A6%99/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/cn/ch0087_season_birthday.ogg"},{"description":"ch0087_season_birthday_player","category":"lobby","text":"祝……祝您生日快乐……为，为了不让您听着不开心， 我就小声说了……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%8D%89%20%E9%81%A5%E9%A6%99/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/cn/ch0087_season_birthday_player.ogg"},{"description":"ch0087_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"老，老师，这，这是我准备了很 久的门松……您，您要是不介 意，还，还请收下…… 我是不是又做错事情了毕竟老师 这么忙我怎么能耽误老师时间不 然我还是现在就去…… 您，您说您很喜欢？诶，嘿嘿， 喜欢就好，祝您新春快乐。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%8D%89%20%E9%81%A5%E9%A6%99/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/cn/ch0087_season_chinesenewyear.ogg"},{"description":"ch0087_season_halloween","category":"lobby","text":"啊……啊，万圣节…… 今，今年我没有开枪……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%8D%89%20%E9%81%A5%E9%A6%99/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/cn/ch0087_season_halloween.ogg"},{"description":"ch0087_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"老，老师，中秋快乐…… 啊，在中秋节我还穿着这身衣 服，一定很奇怪吧……我真是 该死，竟然为了这种显而易见 的事情打扰您…… 对不起对不起对不起对不起对不 起对不起……诶…… 您说很可爱……真，真的吗……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%8D%89%20%E9%81%A5%E9%A6%99/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/cn/ch0087_season_midautumn.ogg"},{"description":"ch0087_season_newyear","category":"lobby","text":"祝您新年快乐……！ 如，如果您讨厌新年的话……我就帮您把新年消灭掉！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%8D%89%20%E9%81%A5%E9%A6%99/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/cn/ch0087_season_newyear.ogg"},{"description":"ch0087_season_xmas","category":"lobby","text":"已，已经到圣诞节了吗……说起来， 圣诞老人来沙勒时， 经过老师的许可了吗……？如果，不是这样的话……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%8D%89%20%E9%81%A5%E9%A6%99/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/cn/ch0087_season_xmas.ogg"},{"description":